// Griddle's resources.
//
// Compiled by tools/build-griddle.ps1 with the Windows SDK's rc.exe and
// handed to the linker as a .res. An icon in the executable is the only kind
// Explorer, the taskbar and Alt+Tab all read: LoadImage at run time can dress
// the window, but it cannot put a picture on the file.
//
// 1 is deliberate. The shell shows the lowest-numbered icon resource as the
// file's icon, so the application icon is always 1 by convention.

1 ICON "griddle.ico"
